DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p><b><u>This distribution has been rescheduled for Frid
 ay\, June 2 due to scheduling conflicts with the distribution location.</u>
 </b></p><p><b><u>Esta distribución ha sido reprogramada para el viernes 2 d
 e junio debido a conflictos de programación con la ubicación de distribució
 n.</u></b></p><p><em><b>Please arrive at least 15 minutes prior to the end 
 of distribution.</b></em></p><p>This site is a drive-through distribution. 
  </p><ul><li>When you arrive at a drive-through site\, please be sure to pa
 y close attention to all signs\, as well as staff and volunteers directing 
 traffic.  We kindly ask that you remain in your vehicle the entire time.  Y
 our groceries will be loaded into your vehicle for you\; please have the do
 or unlocked and ensure that there is space available for the food.  </li><l
 i>Those without transportation are still welcome to visit drive-through Mob
 ile Harvest sites and will be served via a walk-up line.  Please respect so
 cial distancing at all times while on site by remaining at least 6ft away f
 rom those not in your household.</li></ul><p>...</p><p><em><b>Llegue al men
 os 15 minutos antes del final de la distribución.</b></em></p><p>Este sitio
  es una distribución servicio al carro.  </p><ul><li>Cuando llegue a un lug
 ar de distribución\, asegúrese de prestar mucha atención a todas las señale
 s\, así como al personal y a los voluntarios que dirigen el tráfico. Le ped
 imos que permanecer en su vehículo todo el tiempo. Sus alimentos se cargará
 n en su vehículo por usted\; por favor\, tenga la puerta desbloqueada y ase
 gúrese de que hay espacio disponible para los alimentos.  </li><li>Aquellos
  que no tengan transporte pueden visitar los lugares de la Mobile Harvest y
  serán atendidos a través de una línea de espera. Por favor\, respete el di
 stanciamiento social en todo momento mientras se encuentre en el lugar perm
 aneciendo a una distancia mínima de 2 metros de las personas que no pertene
 cen a su hogar.</li></ul><hr /><p>Access to nutritious\, healthful food is 
 vital for the community members we serve. The Food Bank's Mobile Harvest pr
 ogram is a great way to make sure that your family has access to healthy\, 
 fresh fruits and vegetables.<br></p><p>...</p><p>El acceso a alimentos nutr
 itivos y saludables es vital para los miembros de la comunidad a los que se
 rvimos. El programa Mobile Harvest del Banco de Alimentos es una excelente 
 manera de asegurarse de que su familia tenga acceso a frutas y verduras fre
 scas y saludables.</p><hr /><h3><strong>Eligibility: </strong></h3><p>Clien
 ts are asked to complete a brief Intake Form when visiting Mobile Harvest. 
 There are no other qualification requirements to receive food through the M
 obile Harvest distribution. <strong>Households are able to access Mobile Ha
 rvest once per week.</strong></p><h3>INTAKE &amp\; CHECK-IN</h3><ul><li><st
 rong>Intake Form: </strong>During your first visit to Mobile Harvest\, and 
 once per year after\, we will need to collect an Intake Form from you.  Ple
 ase know that your responses to the questions on this form are completely c
 onfidential and in no way impact your ability to receive food assistance th
 rough Mobile Harvest.  If you have a printer available to you\, you can mak
 e the intake process on-site even faster by downloading and completing this
  form prior to arriving at the site.  <u><a href="https://fbnn.org/wp-conte
 nt/uploads/2021/06/FBNN-Client-Intake-Form-as-of-20210701-English.pdf">Inta
 ke Form in English</a></u></li><li><strong>Barcode IDs: </strong>If you hav
 e an ID that has a barcode on it\, we ask that you provide this during chec
 k-in\, as it can greatly speed up the check-in process.  Please note\, IDs 
 are not required\, and you will still be happily served with or without one
 .  This request simply helps to move the line along more quickly.</li></ul>
 <h3>HAVING OTHERS PICK FOOD UP ON YOUR BEHALF</h3><ul><li>If you are unable
  to make it to a distribution for any reason\, you may have a friend/family
  member pick up your food <em><strong>if you have completed an Authorizatio
 n Form and designated the person on this form. </strong></em>You may design
 ate up to three people to pick up food on your behalf.  Your household may 
 still only receive food once per week\, regardless of who is attending the 
 distribution.</li><li>If you have not already completed the Authorization F
 orm\, you may download and complete it here and have the person bring it wi
 th them to the distribution: <a href="https://fbnn.org/wp-content/uploads/2
 021/09/TEFAP-Authorized-Rep-Form-FY21.pdf"><u>Authorization Form in English
 </u></a></li><li>Please note\, you must already have a form on file with us
  OR the person attending the distribution must bring the form completed and
  signed by you with them\, or we will not be able to allow them to pick up 
 food on your behalf.</li><li>If you are a designated person picking up for 
 another household: You may get food for YOUR household and ONE other househ
 old each week.  You may be an authorized person for more than one household
  but will not be able to get food for multiple on any given week.</li></ul>
 <p>...</p><h3><strong>ELEGIBILIDAD: </strong></h3><p>Se les pide a los clie
 ntes que completen un breve formulario de admisión cuando visiten Mobile Ha
 rvest. No hay otros requisitos de calificación para recibir alimentos a tra
 vés de la distribución de Mobile Harvest. <strong>Los hogares pueden accede
 r a Mobile Harvest una vez por semana.</strong></p><h3>ADMISIÓN Y REGISTRO<
 /h3><ul><li><strong>Formulario de admisión:</strong> Durante su primera vis
 ita a Mobile Harvest\, y una vez al año después\, necesitaremos recopilar u
 n formulario de admisión de usted. Tenga en cuenta que sus respuestas a las
  preguntas de este formulario son completamente confidenciales y de ninguna
  manera afectan su capacidad para recibir asistencia alimentaria a través d
 e Mobile Harvest. Si tiene una impresora disponible\, puede hacer que el pr
 oceso de admisión en el sitio sea aún más rápido descargando y completando 
 este formulario antes de llegar al sitio. <u><a href="https://fbnn.org/wp-c
 ontent/uploads/2021/06/FBNN-Client-Intake-Form-as-of-20210701-Spanish.pdf">
 Formulario de admisión en español</a></u></li><li><strong>ID de código de b
 arras:</strong> Si tiene una identificación que tiene un código de barras\,
