 re provided for the whole family!</b><br><br>🚗&nbsp\;CAR ENTRANCE AT SIDEH
 ILL DR.<br><br>Available Resources include:<br><ul><li>Pool Passes for the 
 first 500 attendees*</li><li>Raffle for Free Children's Bikes*</li><li>Scol
 iosis Evaluations (ages 3 to 17)</li><li>Vision Screenings</li><li>Vaccines
 * (Back to School\, Routine &amp\; COVID-19)</li><li>Backpacks &amp\; Schoo
 l Supplies*</li><li>Blood Pressure Checks</li><li>Registration for Food Sta
 mps/SNAP</li><li>Food from Mobile Harvest</li><li>Children's Books for ages
  0 to 10 yrs old*</li><li>AND MORE!</li></ul><br>*While supplies last<br><b
 r><b><i>Thank you to Aetna for sponsoring the July Family Health Festival!<
 /i></b><br><br>A collaborative service brought to you by: Washoe County Hea
 lth District\, Food Bank of Northern Nevada\, Renown Health\, Immunize Neva
 da\, United Way of Northern Nevada and the Sierra\, Community Health Allian
 ce\, and 5210 Healthy Washoe.&nbsp\;
