DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p><em><b>Please arrive at least 15 minutes prior to the
  end of distribution.</b></em></p><p>This site is a drive-through distribut
 ion.  </p><ul><li>When you arrive at a drive-through site\, please be sure 
 to pay close attention to all signs\, as well as staff and volunteers direc
 ting traffic.  We kindly ask that you remain in your vehicle the entire tim
 e.  Your groceries will be loaded into your vehicle for you\; please have t
 he door unlocked and ensure that there is space available for the food.  </
 li><li>Those without transportation are still welcome to visit drive-throug
 h Mobile Harvest sites and will be served via a walk-up line.  Please respe
 ct social distancing at all times while on site by remaining at least 6ft a
 way from those not in your household.</li></ul><p>...</p><p><em><b>Llegue a
 l menos 15 minutos antes del final de la distribución.</b></em></p><p>Este 
